        description {Audits all files and returns the names of those that are out of date, separated by spaces. This command ignores the Audit settings in the ADB file.}
        returns {A string of out-of-date file names separated by spaces, or an empty string when all files are current.}
        example {get_out_of_date_files}
        source {Libero SoC v11.8 Tcl Command Reference}
